      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 516: 🔴 `a\u003drtcp-mux` is currently added whenever local mux is enabled, regardless of offer/answer context. In SDP offer/answer, an answer must only include `rtcp-mux` if it was present in the corresponding offer (RFC 5761 with RFC 3264 semantics). Advertising it unconditionally in answers can negotiate an invalid transport mode with strict peers. Gate `addRTCPMuxAttribute()` so it is sent in offers, and in answers only when the remote media offer contained `rtcp-mux`.",
